{
  "configuration_id": "config_032",
  "reason": "The strongest evidence is for multimodal multiprofile scvi + resnet50, where weighted fusion beats concat under avgpool and transformer aggregation further improves performance under weighted fusion. However, it is unclear whether the gain from config_031 to config_033 is driven mainly by transformer aggregation, weighted fusion, or their interaction. config_032 keeps the same RNA encoder, image encoder, profile setting, and aggregation as the current best config_033 but changes only fusion from weighted to concat. This completes the fusion-by-aggregation comparison, directly tests whether transformer aggregation helps even with concat, and clarifies whether weighted fusion is necessary. It is a single-factor, low-risk extension of the most promising direction and is more informative than immediately testing a new image encoder while the aggregation/fusion interaction remains unresolved."
}

